command: env -u HERDR_ENV -u HERDR_PANE_ID -u HERDR_TAB_ID -u HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID herdr --session pipeline_spike pane current
exit: 0
herdr: 0.9.0
session: pipeline_spike (isolated headless server)
note: with the HERDR_* vars removed herdr does not fail; it falls back to the session's focused pane, which is not the caller's pane
